WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:01.738
QuietNote tackles a race:

00:00:01.738 --> 00:00:04.397
two readers opening a one-time link
together.

00:00:04.765 --> 00:00:07.281
Next.js and Hono handle the request.

00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:11.456
One conditional PostgreSQL update lets
a single reader claim the note.

00:00:11.456 --> 00:00:14.574
Owners can also set expiry or revoke
access.

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:19.501
Next, add retention controls and test
the counters under heavier traffic.
